an10.27:17.1 starts: (8) “When it was said:
an10.27:17.2 starts: with reference to what was this said?
an10.27:17.3 starts: When a bhikkhu is completely disenchanted with eight things,
an10.27:17.4 starts: What eight things?
an10.27:17.5 starts: The eight worldly conditions.
