an10.27:18.1 starts: (9) “When it was said: ‘A question about nine,
an10.27:18.2 starts: with reference to what was this said?
an10.27:18.3 starts: When a bhikkhu is completely disenchanted with nine things,
an10.27:18.4 starts: What nine things?
an10.27:18.5 starts: The nine abodes of beings.
an10.27:18.6 starts: When a bhikkhu is completely disenchanted with these nine things
